{% doc %}
  Editorial Luxury Hero Banner for Samyak Hair Accessories
  Matches exact visual design, typography, botanical accents, and layered collage in image_3625e2.jpg:
  - Height: calc(100vh - 96px) / calc(100dvh - 96px), min-height: 560px.
  - Background: Champagne/sand gradient with sunlit window-blind diagonal shadow streaks.
  - Botanical SVG line-art accents in warm gold (#B59B72, opacity: 0.45).
  - Left column: gold line+dot+line ornaments, eyebrow "THE ART OF ADORNMENT", 54px emerald serif headline, and double-ring luxury pill CTA "EXPLORE THE COLLECTION".
  - Right column: overlapping 2-photo collage (tall model portrait + framed flat-lay photo with drop shadow).
{% enddoc %}

<section class="samyak-editorial-hero" aria-label="Samyak Hair Accessories - The Art of Adornment">
